              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sara Tennyson Blakely"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Love this!! Way better than store brand hummus. The walnuts give it a great flavor. My daughter is allergic to sesame seeds and this gives us a great alternative to traditional hummus!",
            "datePublished": "2011-05-04T11:23:47.413Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Christina"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We thought this was very good! I did end up having to add extra italian dressing and even a little of the liquid from the beans to get a nice consistancy. I served this with homemade pita chips that were seasoned with garlic powder, sea salt and cracked pepper. Not your traditional hummus, but still very tasty! I am looking forward to playing around with some other additions. Thanks for sharing. :)",
